# Open-Meteo Explorer
# All weather data APIs are keyless — the app runs with no configuration at all.

# Optional override for the download logger. The live Apps Script endpoint is
# committed as a default in src/utils/downloadTracking.js, so every deploy
# target (GitHub Pages, Vercel, previews, local dev) logs downloads with no
# configuration. Set this only to point a build at a different script — or to
# "off" to disable download capture entirely for this build.
# Setup for a new script: scripts/apps-script/README.md
# VITE_DOWNLOAD_LOG_ENDPOINT=
